### =====================================================================
### Phase 6: closing and reopening months
### Uses the October 2026 test data from the Phase 4 and 5 files.
### Update the manager password in step 1 if you changed it.
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@month = {{base}}/months/2026/10


### 1. Log in as the manager
# @name managerLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "manager", "password": "changeme123" }

@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.token}}


### 2. Close October → 200, "status": "CLOSED", with frozen totalMeals / totalExpense / mealRate
POST {{month}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 3. Closing it again → 409 "already closed"
POST {{month}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 4. Adding an expense to a closed month → 409 "October 2026 is closed"
POST {{month}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expenseDate": "2026-10-20", "category": "Late groceries", "amount": 500,
  "fundedBy": "FLAT_CASH", "holderMemberId": 1 }


### 5. Editing meals in a closed month → 409
PUT {{month}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "entries": [ { "memberId": 1, "date": "2026-10-20", "meals": 2 } ] }


### 6. Reports still work for closed months
GET {{month}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 7. Open November
POST {{base}}/months
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "year": 2026, "month": 11 }


### 8. November accounts: each "openingBalance" = October's frozen closing balance
GET {{base}}/months/2026/11/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 9. November cash starts with October's closing cash
GET {{base}}/months/2026/11/cash
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 10. Reopen without a reason → 400
POST {{month}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }


### 11. Reopen October with a reason → 200, "status": "OPEN"
POST {{month}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Forgot to add the late groceries" }


### 12. Now the late expense is accepted → 201
POST {{month}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expenseDate": "2026-10-20", "category": "Late groceries", "amount": 500,
  "fundedBy": "FLAT_CASH", "holderMemberId": 1 }


### 13. Close October again → the meal rate now includes the 500
POST {{month}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 14. November's opening balances have updated automatically
GET {{base}}/months/2026/11/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 15. Closing November now → 409 "No meals" (nobody has eaten in November yet)
POST {{base}}/months/2026/11/close
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
